%% Streaming architecture
flowchart TB
  PROD[Producers] --> KAFKA[Kafka Topics by domain]
  KAFKA --> CS[Consumer Services]
  CS --> SILVER[(Silver Stores)]
  CS --> ALERT[Alert Enricher]
  ALERT --> SSE[SSE / WebSocket Gateway]
  SILVER --> GOLD_JOB[Micro-batch Gold Jobs]
  GOLD_JOB --> GOLD[(Gold Facts)]
  GOLD --> CACHE[Redis Query Cache]
  CACHE --> API[REST/GraphQL]
  SSE --> UI[NOC / Cases / Feeds]
  API --> UI
